    "Dana's AI batched the release: 6 PRs merged, QA green on staging. It needs your go before the Friday demo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dana の AI がリリースをまとめました：6 件の PR をマージ、ステージングの QA は緑。金曜のデモ前にあなたの承認が必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auth latency: rollback or hotfix?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "認証の遅延：ロールバックか緊急修正か"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "p95 is up 18% since yesterday's deploy. Bob's AI drafted both paths — rollback is instant, the hotfix lands in ~2 hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨日のデプロイ以降 p95 が 18% 悪化。Bob の AI が両案を用意しました — ロールバックは即時、緊急修正は約2時間です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the empty-state illustration set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空状態のイラストを選んでください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Carol's AI shortlisted 3 candidates that match the flat design. Design handoff is blocked on your pick.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carol の AI がフラットデザインに合う候補を3案に絞りました。あなたの選択待ちでデザインの引き渡しが止まっています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the auth latency hotfix": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "認証遅延の緊急修正を担当する"
